  "content": "<p>BAE Systems plc is a British multinational aerospace, defense, and security company headquartered in London. It is the largest defense contractor in Europe and ranks among the world's largest defense companies. The company provides a comprehensive range of products and services for air, land, and naval forces, as well as advanced electronics, security, information technology solutions, and support services. Key programs include the production of the Eurofighter Typhoon, the F-35 Lightning II, and various naval vessels and armored vehicles, serving government and commercial customers globally.</p>\n",
  "tabs": [
    {
      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Charles%20Woodburn\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Charles Woodburn</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">July 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Executive</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Charles joined BAE Systems in 2017 as Chief Operating Officer and was appointed Chief Executive later that year. He previously held senior roles at Schlumberger and Expro Group.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Brad%20Greve\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Brad Greve</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Group Finance Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Brad joined the Company in 2019 and was appointed Group Finance Director in 2020. He has extensive experience in the oil and gas industry, having held senior roles at Schlumberger.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Tom%20Arseneault\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Tom Arseneault</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President and CEO, BAE Systems, Inc.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Tom is President and CEO of BAE Systems, Inc. and an Executive Director of BAE Systems plc. He has held various senior leadership positions within the US business.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Karin%20Hoeing\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Karin Hoeing</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2018</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Group Human Resources Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Karin joined BAE Systems in 2018 as Group Human Resources Director. She previously worked at Schlumberger for over 20 years in various international roles.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Edward%20%22Ed%22%20Gelsthorpe\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Edward \"Ed\" Gelsthorpe</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Group General Counsel</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ed was appointed Group General Counsel in 2023. He joined BAE Systems in 2007 and has held several senior legal roles across the Group.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Cressida%20Hogg\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Cressida Hogg</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chair</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Cressida was appointed Chair in 2023. She was previously Chair of Land Securities Group PLC and has significant experience in infrastructure and private equity.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Dame%20Elizabeth%20Corley\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Dame Elizabeth Corley</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Non-Executive Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Elizabeth is the Senior Independent Director. She was formerly CEO of Allianz Global Investors and has extensive experience in the financial services industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Jane%20Griffiths\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Jane Griffiths</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Non-Executive Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Jane had a long career at Johnson & Johnson, including as Company Group Chairman of Janssen EMEA. She brings expertise in highly regulated global industries.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Cressida%20Hogg\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Cressida Hogg</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chair</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Cressida was appointed Chair in 2023. She was previously Chair of Land Securities Group PLC and has significant experience in infrastructure and private equity.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Dame%20Elizabeth%20Corley\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Dame Elizabeth Corley</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Senior Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Elizabeth is the Senior Independent Director. She was formerly CEO of Allianz Global Investors and has extensive experience in the financial services industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Nicholas%20Anderson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Nicholas Anderson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">November 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Non-Executive Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Nicholas is the Group Chief Executive of Spirax-Sarco Engineering plc. He brings significant international engineering and operational experience.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Jane%20Griffiths\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Jane Griffiths</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Non-Executive Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Jane had a long career at Johnson & Johnson, including as Company Group Chairman of Janssen EMEA. She brings expertise in highly regulated global industries.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Mark%20Sedwill\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Mark Sedwill</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">November 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Non-Executive Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mark was formerly Cabinet Secretary and National Security Adviser. He has extensive experience in national security, international relations, and public policy.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ewan%20Kirk\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ewan Kirk</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Non-Executive Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ewan is a technology entrepreneur and was the co-founder of Cantab Capital Partners. He brings deep expertise in technology, data science, and mathematics.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Brad%20Greve\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Brad Greve</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Group Finance Director & Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Brad joined the Company in 2019 and was appointed Group Finance Director in 2020. He has extensive experience in the oil and gas industry, having held senior roles at Schlumberger.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.baesystems.com/en/our-company/about-us/board-of-directors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Official BAE Systems Board of Directors page</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-20)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.baesystems.com/en/our-company/about-us/executive-committee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Official BAE Systems Executive Committee page</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-20)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.baesystems.com/en/investors/annual-reports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">BAE Systems Annual Report 2023</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-02-21)</span></li></ul>"
    }
